1. mORMot2 (third_party/mORMot2, synopse/mORMot2)
   Copyright (C) Arnaud Bouchez.
   Licence: a choice of MPL 1.1, GPL 2.0, or LGPL 2.1 with the FPC modified
   LGPL linking exception.
   This product uses the mORMot2 async, socket, TLS and ALPN units at build
   time and at run time. The mORMot2 checkout is a pinned external
   dependency at revision b2b195da1e0580058672a88620ef71bb47283eb1. It is
   not part of the http2server source distribution.
   That revision carries the aarch64 lock fix of `b2b195d` ("Locked*() are
   now full memory barriers on FPC non-Intel CPUs"): on aarch64 FPC builds
   the `Interlocked*` calls of a `TLightLock` without a memory barrier, so
   the lock and unlock of mORMot2's pending-event list published no write and
   the IO pool failed with an access violation under load. An earlier
   revision `2ccea1a0e5d7be85bd3cf68e1fd70e9e603d09cc` predates that fix.

